  "subject": "系统情报学研究科_全专攻",
  "text": "对于以下积分问题作答：\n\n(1-a) 对于正实数 $t > 0$，求积分 $\\int_0^t xe^{-x}dx$ 的值。\n\n(1-b) 求广义积分 $\\int_0^{\\infty} xe^{-x}dx$ 的值。\n\n(1-c) 证明广义积分 $\\int_0^{\\infty} xe^{-x}\\sin(\\sqrt{x})dx$ 收敛。",
  "knowledge_points": [
    "分部积分法",
    "无穷积分",
    "广义积分的收敛性",
    "被积函数的上界估计",
    "指数衰减函数",
    "绝对收敛判别法"
  ],
  "question_type": "多阶段积分计算与收敛性证明",
  "method": [
    "分部积分法",
    "极限运算",
    "比较判别法"
  ],
  "solution_steps": [
    "(1-a) 用分部积分计算定积分 $\\int_0^t xe^{-x}dx$",
    "(1-b) 对(1-a)结果取极限 $t \\to \\infty$",
    "(1-c) 利用(1-b)结果通过比较判别法证明收敛"
  ],
  "math_structure": {
    "type": "integration_by_parts_sequence",
    "template": "$\\int_0^a xe^{-x}dx$ 的分部积分及其极限行为",
    "variable_count": 2
  },
  "difficulty": 2,
  "answer": [
    {
      "label": "(1-a) 定积分计算",
      "steps": [
        "使用分部积分法，设 $u = x, dv = e^{-x}dx$",
        "则 $du = dx, v = -e^{-x}$",
        "$$\\int_0^t xe^{-x}dx = \\left[-xe^{-x}\\right]_0^t + \\int_0^t e^{-x}dx$$",
        "$$= -te^{-t} + \\left[-e^{-x}\\right]_0^t = -te^{-t} - e^{-t} + 1$$",
        "$$= 1 - (t+1)e^{-t}$$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "(1-b) 广义积分计算",
      "steps": [
        "由(1-a)的结果，令 $t \\to \\infty$：",
        "$$\\int_0^{\\infty} xe^{-x}dx = \\lim_{t \\to \\infty}\\left[1 - (t+1)e^{-t}\\right]$$",
        "因为 $\\lim_{t \\to \\infty}(t+1)e^{-t} = 0$（指数函数衰减快于幂函数增长）",
        "所以 $\\int_0^{\\infty} xe^{-x}dx = 1$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "(1-c) 收敛性证明",
      "steps": [
        "对于 $x > 0$，有 $|\\sin(\\sqrt{x})| \\le 1$",
        "因此 $|xe^{-x}\\sin(\\sqrt{x})| \\le xe^{-x}$",
        "由(1-b)知 $\\int_0^{\\infty} xe^{-x}dx = 1$ 收敛",
        "由比较判别法，$\\int_0^{\\infty} xe^{-x}\\sin(\\sqrt{x})dx$ 绝对收敛",
        "所以该广义积分收敛"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "practice_questions": [
    {
      "text": "求积分 $\\int_0^t (x+1)e^{-x}dx$，并讨论当 $t \\to \\infty$ 时的极限。",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "分部积分法",
        "无穷积分的极限"
      ],
      "question_type": "定积分与广义积分",
      "method": [
        "分部积分法",
        "极限运算"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "使用分部积分分别计算 $\\int x e^{-x}dx$ 和 $\\int e^{-x}dx$",
        "求和并取极限"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "polynomial_exponential_integration",
        "template": "$\\int_0^t P(x)e^{-x}dx$ 的分部积分",
        "variable_count": 1
      },
      "difficulty": 1,
      "estimated_minutes": 8,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "完整解答",
          "steps": [
            "分别计算两项：",
            "$$\\int_0^t e^{-x}dx = 1 - e^{-t}$$",
            "$$\\int_0^t xe^{-x}dx = 1 - (t+1)e^{-t}$$（由题目已知）",
            "$$\\int_0^t (x+1)e^{-x}dx = [1 - (t+1)e^{-t}] + [1 - e^{-t}] = 2 - (t+2)e^{-t}$$",
            "当 $t \\to \\infty$ 时，$(t+2)e^{-t} \\to 0$，所以极限为 $2$"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "kobe-2025-07c5afeba8-q01-practice-01",
      "school": "神户大学",
      "year": "2025"
    },
    {
      "text": "求广义积分 $\\int_0^{\\infty} x^2 e^{-x}dx$。（提示：可用分部积分两次或者利用Gamma函数的性质）",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "分部积分法",
        "Gamma函数",
        "无穷积分"
      ],
      "question_type": "广义积分计算",
      "method": [
        "分部积分法",
        "递推关系"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "第一次分部积分得到 $\\int xe^{-x}dx$ 的表达式",
        "第二次分部积分或直接利用已知结果",
        "取极限求得广义积分值"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "power_exponential_integration",
        "template": "$\\int_0^{\\infty} x^n e^{-x}dx$ 的计算",
        "variable_count": 1
      },
      "difficulty": 2,
      "estimated_minutes": 10,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "完整解答",
          "steps": [
            "第一次分部积分：令 $u = x^2, dv = e^{-x}dx$，得 $du = 2x dx, v = -e^{-x}$",
            "$$\\int_0^t x^2 e^{-x}dx = \\left[-x^2 e^{-x}\\right]_0^t + 2\\int_0^t xe^{-x}dx$$",
            "$$= -t^2 e^{-t} + 2\\int_0^t xe^{-x}dx$$",
            "第二项由题目(1-a)(1-b)知，$\\int_0^t xe^{-x}dx = 1 - (t+1)e^{-t}$",
            "$$\\int_0^t x^2 e^{-x}dx = -t^2 e^{-t} + 2[1 - (t+1)e^{-t}] = 2 - (t^2 + 2t + 2)e^{-t}$$",
            "当 $t \\to \\infty$ 时，$(t^2 + 2t + 2)e^{-t} \\to 0$",
            "所以 $\\int_0^{\\infty} x^2 e^{-x}dx = 2$"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "kobe-2025-07c5afeba8-q01-practice-02",
