      "text": "利用分部积分法求 $\\int_0^{\\infty} x e^{-2x}dx$。",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "分部积分法",
        "参数变化",
        "无穷积分"
      ],
      "question_type": "广义积分计算",
      "method": [
        "分部积分法"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "设定分部积分的 $u$ 和 $dv$",
        "计算并应用分部积分公式",
        "处理极限项"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "linear_exponential_integration",
        "template": "$\\int_0^{\\infty} x e^{-ax}dx$ 的计算（$a > 0$）",
        "variable_count": 1
      },
      "difficulty": 1,
      "estimated_minutes": 6,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "完整解答",
          "steps": [
            "令 $u = x, dv = e^{-2x}dx$",
            "则 $du = dx, v = -\\frac{1}{2}e^{-2x}$",
            "$$\\int_0^t x e^{-2x}dx = \\left[-\\frac{x}{2}e^{-2x}\\right]_0^t + \\frac{1}{2}\\int_0^t e^{-2x}dx$$",
            "$$= -\\frac{t}{2}e^{-2t} + \\frac{1}{2}\\left[-\\frac{1}{2}e^{-2x}\\right]_0^t$$",
            "$$= -\\frac{t}{2}e^{-2t} - \\frac{1}{4}e^{-2t} + \\frac{1}{4}$$",
            "$$= \\frac{1}{4} - \\left(\\frac{t}{2} + \\frac{1}{4}\\right)e^{-2t}$$",
            "当 $t \\to \\infty$ 时，$\\left(\\frac{t}{2} + \\frac{1}{4}\\right)e^{-2t} \\to 0$",
            "所以 $\\int_0^{\\infty} x e^{-2x}dx = \\frac{1}{4}$"
          ]
        }
      ],
